/S /P
/ActualText ( The presence of Principal Sir underscored the significance of CRUX as a platform for fostering innovation and academic excellence. His encouragement and support inspired both participants and organisers alike. Additionally, the unwavering guidance and support from our faculty adviser and HOD further enriched the event, setting a precedent for future endeavours.)
