223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In this section, we showcase the captivating visual representations that adorned CRUX 2024. These artworks encapsulated the essence of innovation, technical excellence, and collaboration that define the event. Each piece of artwork serves as a testament to the creativity and talent of the participants and organisers. Explore the intricate details and vibrant colours that breathe life into CRUX, making it an unforgettable experience for all.)
