/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Mr. Chalapathiraju Kanumuri Awarded Ph.D. in Electrical and Electronics Engineering Sciences)
/E (Mr. Chalapathiraju Kanumuri Awarded Ph.D. in Electrical and Electronics Engineering Sciences)
