/ActualText (Mr. Venkat Sunkara CEO of ChipEdge & team recently visited our college on 27 th February,2024. They havre had detailed discussions with the Faculty of ECE, on how we need to modify the curriculum of the B.Tech honors program in VLSI as per industry skill requirements and also fine-tune the electives to create 2 separate core domain specializations in VLSI &amp; embedded. And subsequently, train the faculty by ChipEdge.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
